# Docker builds that use the repository root as context (the relay image and
# the test lab) install dependencies and compile inside the image. Keep local
# installs, build output and release files out of the build context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/dist-electron
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/desktop/release
packages/desktop/relay-runtime
packages/app/android
packages/relay/data
tests/lab/artifacts
.kant-secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
